Bound AirPlay control requests and preserve event-loop progress for slow peers.

When running UxPlay with HLS disabled (-nh), keep
0002-enforce-disabled-hls.patch: its HTTP/1.1 guard makes the HLS handlers and
their direct FCUP socket writer unreachable. Enabling HLS needs queued
nonblocking FCUP output as well.

